        <title type="html"><![CDATA[FF154 RTCDtlsTransport error event]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30094</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30094"/>
        <updated>2026-07-21T05:47:35.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF154 adds support for the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCDtlsTransport/error_event" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">error</code> event</a> on <code class="notranslate">RTCDtlsTransport</code> in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1805447" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1805447</a>. This adds the sub feature.</p>
<p dir="auto">Also tested in <a href="https://collector.openwebdocs.org/tests/api/RTCDtlsTransport/error_event" rel="nofollow">https://collector.openwebdocs.org/tests/api/RTCDtlsTransport/error_event</a></p>
